      "translation": {"english_text": "What......", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": []}
    },
    {
      "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s006-u008",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 6,
      "source": {"source_path": "works/tirumbippaar/dialogues/records/scene-06.json", "canonical_scene_path": "works/tirumbippaar/scenes/scene-06.md", "source_record_id": "tirumbippaar-s006-d005", "source_occurrence_id": null, "source_locator": null, "speaker_label": "பரந்தாமன்", "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 16, "printed_page": 8}]},
      "translation": {"english_text": "Don't be afraid! Not with this rope. With a turmeric-dyed marriage cord around your emerald-jewel neck. (Bama is shy.) Bama! What I said is right, isn't it? Come on, say it...... (Bama smiles.) Ah! A breeze that subdues a storm, a block of ice that quenches a volcano—I have never even heard of such a thing!... Yet I can see that wondrous power in a single smile of yours.", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": ["`மாங்கல்யக் கயிறு` is rendered as `marriage cord`; the source imagery and embedded actions remain within the immutable dialogue-linked unit."]}
    },
    {
      "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s006-u009",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 6,
      "source": {"source_path": "works/tirumbippaar/dialogues/records/scene-06.json", "canonical_scene_path": "works/tirumbippaar/scenes/scene-06.md", "source_record_id": "tirumbippaar-s006-d006", "source_occurrence_id": null, "source_locator": null, "speaker_label": "பாமா", "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 16, "printed_page": 8}]},
      "translation": {"english_text": "I hope all this doesn't end up being mere description?", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": ["The literary-register `வர்ணனை` is retained as `description` rather than expanded into an inferred promise."]}
    },
    {
      "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s006-u010",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 6,
      "source": {"source_path": "works/tirumbippaar/dialogues/records/scene-06.json", "canonical_scene_path": "works/tirumbippaar/scenes/scene-06.md", "source_record_id": "tirumbippaar-s006-d007", "source_occurrence_id": null, "source_locator": null, "speaker_label": "பரந்தாமன்", "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 16, "printed_page": 8}]},
      "translation": {"english_text": "Why the doubt! (Putting a hand on her shoulder) I only met you yesterday. Are you afraid that today I touch and play with you, and tomorrow I will run away? You sweet-tongued one! Didn't you read carefully what I wrote in Illara Jothi?", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": ["The book title `இல்லற ஜோதி` is transliterated consistently; no claim is added about its true authorship inside the translation."]}
    },
    {
      "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s006-u011",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 6,
      "source": {"source_path": "works/tirumbippaar/dialogues/records/scene-06.json", "canonical_scene_path": "works/tirumbippaar/scenes/scene-06.md", "source_record_id": "tirumbippaar-s006-d008", "source_occurrence_id": null, "source_locator": null, "speaker_label": "பாமா", "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 16, "printed_page": 8}]},
      "translation": {"english_text": "Will you live as you wrote?", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": []}
    },
    {
      "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s006-u012",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 6,
      "source": {"source_path": "works/tirumbippaar/dialogues/records/scene-06.json", "canonical_scene_path": "works/tirumbippaar/scenes/scene-06.md", "source_record_id": "tirumbippaar-s006-d009", "source_occurrence_id": null, "source_locator": null, "speaker_label": "பரந்தாமன்", "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 16, "printed_page": 8}]},
      "translation": {"english_text": "(Dismissively) Women are always creatures of suspicion like this.", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": ["The dismissive generalization is translated without softening or endorsement."]}
    },
    {
      "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s006-u013",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "status": "verified",
      "target_language": "en",
      "canonical_scene": 6,
      "source": {"source_path": "works/tirumbippaar/dialogues/records/scene-06.json", "canonical_scene_path": "works/tirumbippaar/scenes/scene-06.md", "source_record_id": "tirumbippaar-s006-d010", "source_occurrence_id": null, "source_locator": null, "speaker_label": "பாமா", "page_provenance": [{"pdf_page": 16, "printed_page": 8}]},
      "translation": {"english_text": "No...no... (turning his face toward her) Look here...", "mode": "prose-faithful", "notes": []}
    },
